Dialogue: 99,0:00:02.42,0:00:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At one time, gods and\Ndemons were as one.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:07.13,0:00:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were sealed away in the\Nabyss of distant memory.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.97,0:00:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hearts of humans who feared\Nthe Dark brought this about.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.97,0:00:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the present, let us call\Nthese beings "Shinma.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.31,0:00:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now they have awakened from their\Nslumber, and gathered in the Dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.65,0:00:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the final night of that gathering,\Nwhen Shinma and Humans met again,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.74,0:00:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a young girl strayed into their midst.\NThis is her story. Her name is...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.58,0:02:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, how cute!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.17,0:02:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that Japanese\Ndolls are kinda spooky?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.55,0:02:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Folks say the dolls' hair grows out,\Nyou know, that sort of thing...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.59,0:02:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.77,0:02:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are suspended in time, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.08,0:02:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She ain't here!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.75,0:02:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really! Where could she be?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.79,0:02:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.79,0:02:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Maybe she's in the club room!\N- Let's go see! !-Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.37,0:03:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Missing...?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not again! This is creepy.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.17,0:03:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They left her for just a moment,\Nand she disappeared!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.00,0:03:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This makes six missing boys and\Ngirls now, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.97,0:03:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda scared.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.26,0:03:44.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's watching him again!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and she just transferred here!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.77,0:03:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, there's no way\NKei's gonna fall for her!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:01.12,0:04:04.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... always seem so bored.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.95,0:04:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about classes?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.50,0:04:10.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about them?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.75,0:04:15.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There they go again!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.46,0:04:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, who's that girl?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.09,0:04:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's an upperclassman. I see\Nher and Kei together a lot.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.60,0:04:28.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hmmm...\N- I'm jealous!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.32,0:04:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to become one with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry and make me like\Nsomeone from your world.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.12,0:04:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.54,0:04:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be impatient. Do you\Nwant me to break my promise?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Promise?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.34,0:04:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To make your beauty last forever...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.22,0:05:00.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.97,0:05:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This body, which will rot and decay into\Nmuck, not too many years from now...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you really?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.18,0:05:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you... I have that power.\NSo don't rush me...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.99,0:05:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you believe this, Larva?\NThis woman who steals my prey?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.21,0:05:37.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On top of which, she's a Shinma!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.30,0:05:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know... Shinma must\Nbe banished, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.63,0:05:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I also need the blood\Nof beautiful people.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.41,0:06:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.12,0:06:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Kayo.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.54,0:06:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are your studies going?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.00,0:06:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mother thinks that maybe you\Nneed a tutor, or something...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.26,0:06:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.43,0:06:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.02,0:06:35.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei! How do you explain\Nthese grades?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try being more like your\Nbrother and sister!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You upset Mom again.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.99,0:06:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't be like you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.45,0:06:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter. We already know that we'll\Ngo to work at Dad's company.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.42,0:06:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The company will do fine\Nwith just you there.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just wanna get away\Nfrom this house.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.80,0:07:04.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been spoiled because\Nyou're the youngest.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.26,0:07:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Mother?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.47,0:07:10.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's out again today. Do you need\Nsomething? I'll do it for you...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.47,0:07:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give some thought to your future!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.41,0:07:31.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.41,0:07:38.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your future is all set!\NWhy are you fighting it?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.36,0:08:05.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, you want\Nme to find someone?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, actually...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.36,0:08:08.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.32,0:08:10.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A doll.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.53,0:08:12.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A doll?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.83,0:08:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you that my daughter disappeared\Nwhile at summer school,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.33,0:08:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the next day, I couldn't sit\Nstill and visited the school,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.30,0:08:27.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,hoping there might\Nbe a clue.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:40.69,0:08:45.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A girl from the Art Club said she\Nsaw something strange
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.27,0:08:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just after my daughter disappeared
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.07,0:08:51.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said there was a strange doll lying\Nwhere my daughter should have been.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.49,0:08:55.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The police wouldn't take it seriously.\NNor would anyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.62,0:09:02.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I got the feeling that, somehow,\Nthat doll was my daughter...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.00,0:09:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doll disappeared\Nall of a sudden.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.71,0:09:11.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think? I know\Nthis isn't much of a clue.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.93,0:09:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.85,0:09:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm desperate enough\Nto try even spiritualism..
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.97,0:09:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your daughter might have been\Nturned into a doll, you think?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.77,0:09:22.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please tell me where\Nher school is.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.06,0:09:25.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure whether this\Nis a job for me, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.57,0:09:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A girl changed into a doll...\Na strange case.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.95,0:09:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the monsters called Shinma\Nmight be behind this incident.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.46,0:09:50.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And where there're Shinma, there's sure to\Nbe that vampire girl I'm searching for...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.39,0:10:08.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No longer will you age or grow decrepit.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.61,0:10:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can live forever looking\Nlike you do now.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.24,0:10:21.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"And thus will the life energy that you\Nemit become my sustenance... I
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.87,0:10:22.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.25,0:10:25.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Miyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.84,0:10:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The vampire who's hunting us down...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.76,0:10:35.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm only returning stray\NShinma to the Dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.05,0:10:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not looking\Nto fight you just now.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came to ask you something.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.94,0:10:55.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you turn Kei Yuzuki into a doll?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.74,0:10:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, who turn young people into dolls,\Nand bask in the lives sealed therein...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:59.87,0:11:00.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not him?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.91,0:11:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see, you have your eye on him too...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.34,0:11:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got the wrong impression.\NI'm not interested in him.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.93,0:11:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei approached me.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.26,0:11:25.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must've discovered somehow that\NI have powers which people don't.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:25.93,0:11:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He asked me to tell him if there was\Na way to preserve his beauty.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he wants to look\Nlike these, though!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:37.99,0:11:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.88,0:11:56.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinma!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.01,0:12:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When next we meet, I will\Nask you once more.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.06,0:12:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be ready with an answer\Nto my question!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.98,0:12:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, please, Kei.\NThere's someone else, isn't there?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.69,0:12:15.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.44,0:12:17.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of person is she?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.45,0:12:22.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure... if it is a person.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.39,0:12:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.85,0:12:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Intriguing sketch.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow... what a cutie.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.78,0:13:05.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Japanese Literature
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind if I sit here?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.66,0:13:11.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.05,0:13:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't go near that\Nwoman, if I were you.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.22,0:13:28.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's eternal life you want,\NI'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.52,0:13:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to live forever, as\Nyou are now, I know a way.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care about that...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.28,0:13:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She knows nothing about\Neternal beauty!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.62,0:13:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you know, but the\Npromise is just an excuse to see her.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.41,0:13:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.42,0:13:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...care about her.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.46,0:14:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love her. She's the only\Nwoman I desire.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.14,0:14:10.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if she's not a being of this\Nworld, that's fine with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.49,0:14:32.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Love? A human "loving" a Shinma?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.92,0:14:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, is that the faculty\Noffice over there?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.47,0:14:46.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.76,0:14:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Faculty Office
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.76,0:14:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Faculty Office\NPardon me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.43,0:14:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need information... about one of your\Nstudents, as quickly as possible. Umm...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.08,0:15:23.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave me alone, Himiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.55,0:15:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you after me?\NOr maybe a Shinma?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.68,0:15:33.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm after you... to keep you from\Nvictimizing anyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.93,0:15:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose your next target is that boy?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.35,0:15:43.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As always, a good-looking victim...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.48,0:15:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right. I like beautiful people.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:47.49,0:15:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why are you just watching him?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:50.49,0:15:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I particularly like him.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.67,0:16:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got a present for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.30,0:16:13.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Holy water.\NHow nice.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What in the world are you?\NBright sunlight has no effect on you,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.73,0:16:20.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you sneer at crosses and holy water!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.19,0:16:21.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampires like that...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.40,0:16:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...do exist. You're looking at one
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name is Miyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.24,0:16:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As the last vampire,\NI hunt the Shinma,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.99,0:16:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,those beings who were once feared\Nas gods, or sometimes as monsters.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.04,0:16:45.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Living and drinking human blood mean\None and the same thing to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.97,0:16:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is Larva, a Shinma bound to me,\Nhaving received my blood.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.10,0:17:02.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any more questions, Himiko?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.90,0:17:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and the Shinma are essentially\Nthe same species, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.61,0:17:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why do you hunt them?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.37,0:17:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're a protector of humans..
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.70,0:17:22.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a strange underclassman\Nnosing around.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.04,0:17:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care about eternal beauty.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.63,0:17:29.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take me to a world where you\Nand I can be together forever.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.01,0:17:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it meant transforming\Nmy body, it wouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.64,0:17:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.01,0:17:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.47,0:17:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know... and it's okay...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.14,0:17:44.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... love you.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"A protector of humans?"\NHmph.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.12,0:18:00.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After I became aware of my vampire\Nheritage, everything changed.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.08,0:18:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In accordance with my duty, I send\Nthem back to their proper world.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.63,0:18:12.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see... My people have been\Ndoing it for generations.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.55,0:18:13.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your "duty?"
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.97,0:18:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's none of your concern...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:33.82,0:18:35.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, Kei...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.70,0:18:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyu... are you after that boy?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.16,0:18:44.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or a new Shinma?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.67,0:18:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Why have you come to this school...?\N- It's both.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.84,0:18:53.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm both hunter... and vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.87,0:19:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Miyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:30.71,0:19:35.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, give him to me. Then I\Nwill return you to the Dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinma... Ranka.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.08,0:20:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:04.91,0:20:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no use for a man like this...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:08.46,0:20:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though I wouldn't give him to a\Ngreedy, grasping girl, either.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.48,0:21:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.52,0:21:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.79,0:21:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:50.35,0:21:51.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a good look.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.39,0:21:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The man who loved you will now receive\Nmy blood, and gain eternal life.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.30,0:22:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You asked me why I didn't\Nturn Kei into a doll.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.48,0:22:36.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:38.52,0:22:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I loved a human being even\Nthough I'm a Shinma...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.99,0:22:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I fell in love with Kei...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:45.53,0:22:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I couldn't transform him into\Na doll, existing but not living.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.95,0:22:52.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinma and humans\Nare different...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:53.20,0:22:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tried to forget about love...\Nbut I was wrong to do so.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.77,0:23:13.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:20.23,0:23:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Miyu?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:22.11,0:23:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you love this beautiful man,\Nnow that he looks like this?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:31.66,0:23:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you drink his blood?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:37.08,0:23:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can love him... in this form.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:41.67,0:23:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's mine... all mine...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:36.39,0:24:37.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Return the Shinma to the Dark!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.82,0:24:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lost, Miyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.41,0:24:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I returned the Shinma, Ranka, to\Nthe Dark, its home...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.79,0:25:01.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't lose.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:03.46,0:25:07.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't mean as the Hunter... I'm talking\Nabout the woman within you.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.55,0:25:12.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:44.96,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:57.64,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(340,303)\p1\c&H080707&}m -340 -303 l 1100 -303 1100 777 -340 777
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.80,0:01:57.64,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)\pos(340,320)\c&HF5F5F5&\blur1.5\fnMADE Awelier Black\b0\fscx140\fscy140}Episodul 2
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.80,0:01:57.64,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)\pos(720,480)\c&HF5F5F5&\blur1.5\an8\fnMADE Awelier Black\b0\fscx200\fscy200}Un banchet \Nal marionetelor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:13:01.78,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Library
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.19,0:19:49.27,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Ranka
Dialogue: 99,0:00:02.42,0:00:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At one time, gods and\Ndemons were as one.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:07.13,0:00:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were sealed away in the\Nabyss of distant memory.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.97,0:00:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hearts of humans who feared\Nthe Dark brought this about.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.97,0:00:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the present, let us call\Nthese beings "Shinma.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.31,0:00:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now they have awakened from their\Nslumber, and gathered in the Dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.65,0:00:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the final night of that gathering,\Nwhen Shinma and Humans met again,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.74,0:00:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a young girl strayed into their midst.\NThis is her story. Her name is...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.58,0:02:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, how cute!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.17,0:02:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that Japanese\Ndolls are kinda spooky?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.55,0:02:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Folks say the dolls' hair grows out,\Nyou know, that sort of thing...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.59,0:02:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.77,0:02:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are suspended in time, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.08,0:02:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She ain't here!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.75,0:02:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really! Where could she be?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.79,0:02:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.79,0:02:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Maybe she's in the club room!\N- Let's go see! !-Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.37,0:03:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Missing...?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not again! This is creepy.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.17,0:03:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They left her for just a moment,\Nand she disappeared!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.00,0:03:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This makes six missing boys and\Ngirls now, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.97,0:03:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda scared.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.26,0:03:44.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's watching him again!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and she just transferred here!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.77,0:03:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, there's no way\NKei's gonna fall for her!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:01.12,0:04:04.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... always seem so bored.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.95,0:04:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about classes?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.50,0:04:10.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about them?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.75,0:04:15.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There they go again!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.46,0:04:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, who's that girl?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.09,0:04:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's an upperclassman. I see\Nher and Kei together a lot.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.60,0:04:28.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hmmm...\N- I'm jealous!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.32,0:04:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to become one with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry and make me like\Nsomeone from your world.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.12,0:04:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.54,0:04:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be impatient. Do you\Nwant me to break my promise?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Promise?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.34,0:04:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To make your beauty last forever...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.22,0:05:00.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.97,0:05:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This body, which will rot and decay into\Nmuck, not too many years from now...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you really?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.18,0:05:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you... I have that power.\NSo don't rush me...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.99,0:05:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you believe this, Larva?\NThis woman who steals my prey?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.21,0:05:37.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On top of which, she's a Shinma!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.30,0:05:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know... Shinma must\Nbe banished, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.63,0:05:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I also need the blood\Nof beautiful people.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.41,0:06:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.12,0:06:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Kayo.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.54,0:06:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are your studies going?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.00,0:06:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mother thinks that maybe you\Nneed a tutor, or something...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.26,0:06:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.43,0:06:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.02,0:06:35.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei! How do you explain\Nthese grades?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try being more like your\Nbrother and sister!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You upset Mom again.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.99,0:06:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't be like you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.45,0:06:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter. We already know that we'll\Ngo to work at Dad's company.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.42,0:06:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The company will do fine\Nwith just you there.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just wanna get away\Nfrom this house.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.80,0:07:04.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been spoiled because\Nyou're the youngest.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.26,0:07:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Mother?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.47,0:07:10.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's out again today. Do you need\Nsomething? I'll do it for you...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.47,0:07:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give some thought to your future!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.41,0:07:31.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.41,0:07:38.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your future is all set!\NWhy are you fighting it?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.36,0:08:05.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, you want\Nme to find someone?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, actually...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.36,0:08:08.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.32,0:08:10.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A doll.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.53,0:08:12.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A doll?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.83,0:08:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you that my daughter disappeared\Nwhile at summer school,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.33,0:08:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the next day, I couldn't sit\Nstill and visited the school,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.30,0:08:27.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,hoping there might\Nbe a clue.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:40.69,0:08:45.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A girl from the Art Club said she\Nsaw something strange
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.27,0:08:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just after my daughter disappeared
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.07,0:08:51.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said there was a strange doll lying\Nwhere my daughter should have been.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.49,0:08:55.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The police wouldn't take it seriously.\NNor would anyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.62,0:09:02.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I got the feeling that, somehow,\Nthat doll was my daughter...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.00,0:09:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doll disappeared\Nall of a sudden.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.71,0:09:11.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think? I know\Nthis isn't much of a clue.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.93,0:09:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.85,0:09:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm desperate enough\Nto try even spiritualism..
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.97,0:09:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your daughter might have been\Nturned into a doll, you think?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.77,0:09:22.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please tell me where\Nher school is.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.06,0:09:25.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure whether this\Nis a job for me, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.57,0:09:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A girl changed into a doll...\Na strange case.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.95,0:09:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the monsters called Shinma\Nmight be behind this incident.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.46,0:09:50.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And where there're Shinma, there's sure to\Nbe that vampire girl I'm searching for...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.39,0:10:08.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No longer will you age or grow decrepit.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.61,0:10:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can live forever looking\Nlike you do now.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.24,0:10:21.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"And thus will the life energy that you\Nemit become my sustenance... I
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.87,0:10:22.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.25,0:10:25.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Miyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.84,0:10:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The vampire who's hunting us down...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.76,0:10:35.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm only returning stray\NShinma to the Dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.05,0:10:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not looking\Nto fight you just now.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came to ask you something.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.94,0:10:55.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you turn Kei Yuzuki into a doll?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.74,0:10:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, who turn young people into dolls,\Nand bask in the lives sealed therein...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:59.87,0:11:00.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not him?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.91,0:11:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see, you have your eye on him too...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.34,0:11:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got the wrong impression.\NI'm not interested in him.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.93,0:11:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei approached me.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.26,0:11:25.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must've discovered somehow that\NI have powers which people don't.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:25.93,0:11:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He asked me to tell him if there was\Na way to preserve his beauty.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he wants to look\Nlike these, though!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:37.99,0:11:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.88,0:11:56.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinma!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.01,0:12:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When next we meet, I will\Nask you once more.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.06,0:12:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be ready with an answer\Nto my question!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.98,0:12:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, please, Kei.\NThere's someone else, isn't there?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.69,0:12:15.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.44,0:12:17.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of person is she?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.45,0:12:22.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure... if it is a person.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.39,0:12:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.85,0:12:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Intriguing sketch.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow... what a cutie.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.78,0:13:05.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Japanese Literature
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind if I sit here?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.66,0:13:11.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.05,0:13:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't go near that\Nwoman, if I were you.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.22,0:13:28.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's eternal life you want,\NI'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.52,0:13:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to live forever, as\Nyou are now, I know a way.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care about that...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.28,0:13:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She knows nothing about\Neternal beauty!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.62,0:13:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you know, but the\Npromise is just an excuse to see her.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.41,0:13:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.42,0:13:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...care about her.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.46,0:14:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love her. She's the only\Nwoman I desire.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.14,0:14:10.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if she's not a being of this\Nworld, that's fine with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.49,0:14:32.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Love? A human "loving" a Shinma?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.92,0:14:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, is that the faculty\Noffice over there?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.47,0:14:46.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.76,0:14:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Faculty Office
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.76,0:14:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Faculty Office\NPardon me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.43,0:14:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need information... about one of your\Nstudents, as quickly as possible. Umm...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.08,0:15:23.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave me alone, Himiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.55,0:15:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you after me?\NOr maybe a Shinma?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.68,0:15:33.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm after you... to keep you from\Nvictimizing anyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.93,0:15:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose your next target is that boy?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.35,0:15:43.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As always, a good-looking victim...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.48,0:15:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right. I like beautiful people.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:47.49,0:15:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why are you just watching him?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:50.49,0:15:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I particularly like him.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.67,0:16:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got a present for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.30,0:16:13.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Holy water.\NHow nice.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What in the world are you?\NBright sunlight has no effect on you,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.73,0:16:20.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you sneer at crosses and holy water!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.19,0:16:21.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampires like that...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.40,0:16:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...do exist. You're looking at one
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name is Miyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.24,0:16:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As the last vampire,\NI hunt the Shinma,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.99,0:16:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,those beings who were once feared\Nas gods, or sometimes as monsters.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.04,0:16:45.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Living and drinking human blood mean\None and the same thing to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.97,0:16:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is Larva, a Shinma bound to me,\Nhaving received my blood.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.10,0:17:02.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any more questions, Himiko?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.90,0:17:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and the Shinma are essentially\Nthe same species, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.61,0:17:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why do you hunt them?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.37,0:17:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're a protector of humans..
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.70,0:17:22.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a strange underclassman\Nnosing around.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.04,0:17:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care about eternal beauty.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.63,0:17:29.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take me to a world where you\Nand I can be together forever.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.01,0:17:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it meant transforming\Nmy body, it wouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.64,0:17:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.01,0:17:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.47,0:17:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know... and it's okay...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.14,0:17:44.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... love you.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"A protector of humans?"\NHmph.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.12,0:18:00.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After I became aware of my vampire\Nheritage, everything changed.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.08,0:18:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In accordance with my duty, I send\Nthem back to their proper world.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.63,0:18:12.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see... My people have been\Ndoing it for generations.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.55,0:18:13.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your "duty?"
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.97,0:18:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's none of your concern...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:33.82,0:18:35.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, Kei...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.70,0:18:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyu... are you after that boy?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.16,0:18:44.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or a new Shinma?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.67,0:18:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Why have you come to this school...?\N- It's both.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.84,0:18:53.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm both hunter... and vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.87,0:19:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Miyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:30.71,0:19:35.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, give him to me. Then I\Nwill return you to the Dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinma... Ranka.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.08,0:20:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:04.91,0:20:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no use for a man like this...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:08.46,0:20:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though I wouldn't give him to a\Ngreedy, grasping girl, either.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.48,0:21:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.52,0:21:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.79,0:21:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:50.35,0:21:51.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a good look.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.39,0:21:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The man who loved you will now receive\Nmy blood, and gain eternal life.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.30,0:22:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You asked me why I didn't\Nturn Kei into a doll.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.48,0:22:36.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:38.52,0:22:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I loved a human being even\Nthough I'm a Shinma...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.99,0:22:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I fell in love with Kei...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:45.53,0:22:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I couldn't transform him into\Na doll, existing but not living.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.95,0:22:52.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinma and humans\Nare different...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:53.20,0:22:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tried to forget about love...\Nbut I was wrong to do so.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.77,0:23:13.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kei...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:20.23,0:23:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Miyu?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:22.11,0:23:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you love this beautiful man,\Nnow that he looks like this?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:31.66,0:23:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you drink his blood?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:37.08,0:23:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can love him... in this form.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:41.67,0:23:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's mine... all mine...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:36.39,0:24:37.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Return the Shinma to the Dark!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.82,0:24:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lost, Miyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.41,0:24:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I returned the Shinma, Ranka, to\Nthe Dark, its home...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.79,0:25:01.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't lose.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:03.46,0:25:07.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't mean as the Hunter... I'm talking\Nabout the woman within you.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.55,0:25:12.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.59,0:25:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
